window.products.push({"id":911009,"name":"wyewye Picture Frames 10x12 Picture Frame Set of 2 Display Pictures 7x9 with Mat or 10x12 Without Mat Real Glass and Composite Wood for Wall Display P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cH8mBqBnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ture memories into artworks with wyewye picture frames. TOP QUALITY MATERIAL wyewye 10x12 picture frame made of wood composite material. They come with Polished Edge Glass for your Safety and protect your photos from dust and moisture. Two-way Display and Easy to Use. Versatile picture frame allows vertically or horizontally display.You can mount them on the walls of your home or office, and they coordinate well with almost any decor.Use the easel to stand each frame on a table top, desk, or shelf.It depends on you. Two Display Sizes Our wall gallery picture frames fit photos of 7x9 with mats or if you remove the mats, they can fit 10x12 images. PLEASE NOTE: The mat opening size is 6.49x8.5 inches, it can press your photos, and better to holds your 7x9 photos. If our frame mat opening size is actually 10x12, your photos will be easy to fall out from picture frame. Make a Great Gifts Give this as a gift to share a cherished memory to your loved one: for your family, grandparents,friends,classmates, teachers and more. These picture frames set of 2 piece is economically-priced so they can be used ina home, studio, hotel, retail store, business lobby and more! It can be combined withother frames to create unique wall art. It is also known as a contemporary photo frame thatwill create a chic picture collage! Fully Assembled Square Saw-tooth hook in the back for hanging on wall easily.The easel stand allows to display on the table or a shelf.Safety use bendable tabs for easy opening and insert the picture.No other assembly needed. PACKAGE INCLUDES ※2 Pack 10x12 Picture Frame (Black)This is definitely a great value package, you deserve it!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cH8mBqBnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"wyewye","source_asin":"B0C4DWRC5W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-911009","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4DWRC5W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4DWRC5W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
