window.products.push({"id":911194,"name":"AISZG 2023 New Vacuum Sealer,Dry/Moist Vacuum Sealer Machine with 10 Vacuum Seal Bags & 1 Air Suction Hose,5-in-1 Easy Options for Food Storage,Gifts ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719GzO97ByL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"5-in-1 Sealing Modes - food sealer vacuum sealer machine has 5 settings — Dry & Moist & External Vac & Seal & Stop(Cancel) — accessible with one-touch operation. The moist mode is particularly important if you tend to package marinated meats, oily foods like fish, or leftovers with residual moisture, since it'll help you get a tight seal regardless of any little droplets of liquid. This feature also makes it great for sous vide. Dry & Moist & Vac Seal & Jar Sealing Modes - The vacuum air sealer machine kitchen appliance accessories provides more vacuuming modes for different kinds of food, choose an appropriate mode will make the sealed foods taste better. Press the stop button to stop vacuuming at any time and this will make it easier to control the vacuuming time according to the food type. Powerful Suction - A highly efficient machine suitable for most household use, thanks to 80kPa powerful suction, preserve food up to 5 times longer than zipper baggies or containers, basically depending on the type of food The Vacuum Sealer however, was subjected to specific laboratory testing to effectively increase food shelf life. Everything You Need Right Out Of The Box - Along with the vacuum sealer and the air suction hose, the vacuum sealer package also includes: 10 medium vacuum bags (7” x 9”) Best Gift Choice - An ideal gift for Valentine's Day,Mother's Day,Father's Day,Christmas and Birthday.The most thoughtful gift for wives and mothers, which can reduce their efficiency in packing up food every day and relieve their stress.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719GzO97ByL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AISZG","source_asin":"B0BM5LFS11","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-911194","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BM5LFS11","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BM5LFS11","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
