window.products.push({"id":911559,"name":"Aikico 30oz Stainless Steel Tumbler, Vacuum Insulated Coffee Tumblers Cups, Durable Wall Travel Mug Tumbler with Splash Proof Sliding Lid and Straws, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UoyiaCIqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍓🍓 PREMIUM TRAVEL TUMBLER：Our travel tumbler is made from 18/8 food grade stainless steel, which is lead free and durable, electro-polished on the inside to ensure your cups remain pure, rust-free, no-metal flavor, giving you a clean tasting drink every time! Durable material allows you say goodbye to replace cheap cups. This sturdy travel tumbler set can be last for many years！ 🍓🍓 DOUBLE-WALLED VACUUM INSULATED：Vacuum insulate stainless steel body and purely stretch-formed copper lining ensure that it is incredibly good at temperature protection. Superb insulation technology keeps your drinks hot for over 6 hours and cold for around 24 hours. You can enjoy your hot morning coffee or cooler drinks! 🍓🍓 SUPERIOR POWDER COATED FINISH：Coated finish makes your tumbler will always feel smooth to the touch and keep its stylish colorful finish. No rust or scratches like painted exteriors. what's more, our tumblers use sweat-free design which prevents sweating and condensation, making sure it never leaves a spot and you never burn yourself again! 🍓🍓 30oz Tumbler with airtight Lid and Straw: It comes with a leak proof lid and reusable straw which both are BPA-Free.The sliding lid has a rubber gasket ensures a tight fit. The sliding lid can be easily closed to prevent leakage and spatter, no need to worry about the drink in the cup flowing out. Suitable size fits the most of car cup holder 🍓🍓 PORTABLE SUPER-CAPACITY COFFEE TUMBLER SET：This 30 oz tumbler set designed for everyday use at home, in the office, outdoor parties and events home and outdoors, suitable for swimming, Sports, Travel, Road trip, Barbecue, Camping, Party, etc. You can share them as gifts on birthday, Thanksgiving and Christmas with your family, friends, teachers and colleagues！","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UoyiaCIqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aikico","source_asin":"B08PKTFWN2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-911559","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PKTFWN2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PKTFWN2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
