window.products.push({"id":911590,"name":"Magic Human Keychains for Women and Men - Good Luck Charms - Cool Car and Key Accessories - Feng Shui Coins Money Bag Charms","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51dNsrfXfkL._AC_UL1010_.jpg","description":"Ancient legend has it that the fortune money bag and wulu ingot are two of the most powerful symbols of good luck. The legend has been passed down through generations, and the symbols are believed to bring luck, success, and wealth. There is a great deal of superstition around the items, particularly among those who firmly believe in their powers. It is thought that they can amplify whatever energies are brought into their presence. These good luck charms have become popular in recent years as more people seek out ways to increase their fortune and harness the power of positive energy. Wearing the charms is believed to boost confidence and bring clarity to our decisions, making sure that we make the right ones for our greater good. Whether you believe in the legend or not, these symbols have become powerful symbols of luck and fortune through the ages and are a reminder to be open to new opportunities that come our way. Carrying and wearing them can act as a source of comfort and assurance that we will always find our way on life's path. Sandalwood is also said to be an excellent aid for meditation and prayer. The sandalwood tree is a slow grower, and it can take up to 30 years for the tree to mature. The heartwood of the sandalwood tree is very valuable. Sandalwood is also said to have metaphysical properties. It is believed to help with concentration and focus and is often used in meditation. Some people also believe that sandalwood can help to attract love and luck. The sandalwood tree is sacred to Hindus and Buddhists. The wood is used to make temples, statues, and altars. The sandalwood tree is also associated with good luck and is often used as a charm to bring good fortune. It is said that the sandalwood tree will only grow in places where there is peace and harmony.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51dNsrfXfkL._AC_UL1010_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Magic Human","source_asin":"B0BQKWBHH2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-911590","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQKWBHH2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQKWBHH2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
