window.products.push({"id":911620,"name":"SOTOGO 24 Pieces Gold Confetti Balloons 12 Inches Party Balloons With Golden Paper Confetti Dots Balloons for Party Decorations Wedding Decorations An","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516RM-9KDsL._AC_.jpg","description":"Function:confetti balloons can meet your needs for party wedding decorations. You can also use them proposal to your lover. Size:uninflated ballon is 13 cm long and 6.5 cm wide, the inflatable diameter is approx. 30.5 cm/ 12 inches, confetti is 2.5 cm in diameter. Quantity:24 pieces confetti balloons can meet your quantities need. Wide applications: this set of confetti balloons can be applied in many different situations, such as festival party,anniversary party, birthday party and so on. Due to the gold confetti is heavier than helium, the gold confetti moves in the direction of gravity. So before you inflate the balloon, spray a little water into the balloon or blow a little water through your mouth that the moisture will help the gold confetti stick to the balloon. Beyond that, rubbing the outer side of the balloon with a dry towel will also help the gold confetti stick to the balloon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516RM-9KDsL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SOTOGO","source_asin":"B073WVY9SG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-911620","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073WVY9SG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073WVY9SG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":911621,"name":"Le Creuset Stoneware 10-Inch Spoon Rest, Cobalt","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714pYDy-hfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep surfaces clean with help from this stoneware spoon rest from Le Creuset. The unit's 10-inch design provides ample space for resting spoons, spatulas, and ladles either on the countertop during cooking or at the table when serving. The unit comes in the shape of a spoon, with space for the head and the handle. It also sports the Le Creuset name in raised letters and Le Creuset's signature concentric rings for an added touch of charm. Le Creuset's line of stoneware comes with a hard-wearing, impermeable finish fired at temperatures as high as 2192 degrees F. With a porosity level of less than 1 percent, it blocks moisture absorption, which can lead to cracking, crazing, and rippling along the interior. Its non-porous construction also resists odors, scratching, and staining for hygienic use and optimal performance. Even more, its high-quality enamel protects against metal marks and other damage, which means it's safe to use with knives. Best of all, the glaze on the exterior makes the stoneware items fun to mix and match with other coordinating Le Creuset pieces (sold separately), while a neutral-colored glaze on the inside offers an optimal palette for food presentation. And thanks to an unmatched thermal resistance from -65 degrees F to 500 degrees F, Le Creuset stoneware moves effortlessly from the microwave or oven (or under the broiler) to the table for serving to the refrigerator or freezer for storing leftovers. When finished, it cleans up easily by hand or in the dishwasher.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714pYDy-hfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Le Creuset","source_asin":"B001FBXC44","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-911621","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001FBXC44","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001FBXC44","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
