window.products.push({"id":911769,"name":"JOYHILL Kids Lunch Bag, Reusable Insulated Lunch Box, Detachable Shoulder Straps Lunch Tote Mom Bag for Women, Cute Lunchbox for Boys Girls (Small, Bl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71byYtNy9WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Material & Durablity: Joyhill kids insulated lunch bag is made of highly durable hot-pressed aluminum foil, pearl cotton, eco-friendly water-resistant Oxford fabric and YKK zipper. The handle is comfortable and easy to carry, featuring dustproof and wear-resistant. The upgraded insulated lining of the kids lunchbox can maintain your food cold/hot/fresh for more than 6 hours, keeping your food healthy. Lightweight & Detachable Shoulder Strap: The dimension of the small lunch bag is 11.4\"*12.2\"*1.18\" with a capacity of 3L, weighing 0.34lbs. It can be used as a crossbody bag as well as a single-shoulder bag, with an 80cm long detachable shoulder strap. The lunch box can fit in most lunch containers. It can be folded to save space when it's idle, meanwhile, it won't cause pressure for it's super lightweight. Large Capacity & Easy to Clean: This lightweight reusable lunch bag can accommodate a large container, still roomy for snacks, utensils, and juice bottles. It's very easy to clean the inner aluminum foil with a damp cloth. When it's not been using, please put the detachable shoulder strap in the bag and store the insulated lunch box in a dry, cool place. Unique Design & Use Occasions: The flat bottom can hold your lunch boxes and water bottles upright, helping you prevent spills. No matter where you are, at work, at school, on the beach, in the gym; or what you are doing, hiking, camping, picnic, etc., you can prepare all your meals and enjoy healthy food with this insulated lunchbox. It's a lunch bag made for all ages. Lifetime Guarantee: All of our Joyhill insulated lunch bag have the written Children's Product Certificate (CPC), it's safe for use by children 12 and under. If you encounter any problems, please contact us in time, we will do our best to solve the problem for you, you will enjoy 100% refund and replacement guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71byYtNy9WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JOYHILL","source_asin":"B0C1B9QR58","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-911769","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1B9QR58","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1B9QR58","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
