window.products.push({"id":911800,"name":"Bel Air Wall Clock Lights Up with Revving Sound","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":249.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oHtfqjHuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Celebrate the revolutionary style of the Chevrolet Bel Air that would set the standard in automobile design for decades to come with this Chevy Bel Air Cuckoo Clock. What a great way to show your passion for this trendsetting car and its distinctive body style in a unique timepiece design that will become the focal point of your home decor. Available exclusively from The Bradford Exchange, this officially licensed clock is limited to an edition of 10,000! Handcrafted with high-gloss metal accents inspired by the Bel Air's iconic tailfins, this Chevy Bel Air Cuckoo Clock features images of the '55, '56 and '57 Chevy Bel Air on the front. An accurate quartz movement powers the swinging metal pendulum, bearing the official Chevy logo, and the speedometer-inspired clock face. Plus, at the top of each hour, the garage lights up to reveal a sculptural 1957 Chevy Bel Air accompanied by the sound of a revving engine! Strong demand is expected. Don't wait a second longer and order now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oHtfqjHuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Bradford Exchange","source_asin":"B0096E7IYC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-911800","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0096E7IYC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0096E7IYC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":911801,"name":"Fur Chair Cushion 20 x 20 inch, Square Fur Seat Cushion, Super Soft Faux Sheepskin Chair Cover Chair Seat Pad, White Fluffy Rug for Children's Room, D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61l8JhsVjcL._AC_SL1124_.jpg","description":"Unrivaled Quality Designed and built using high quality faux sheepskin, fur length up to 2.8 inches, super soft and smooth, skin-friendly, no smell and no shed. Unparalleled Experience Fur Chair Cushion is super soft and fluffy, just like sitting on a sponge, very comfortable. Superb Craftsmanship Fur Seat Cushion has non-slip design on the back, which will not move at all when you use it, bring you the perfect experience. Easey Clean and Care Faux Fur Chair Cover can be machine washed or hand washed, hang it in a ventilated place to dry when it is done. Multiple Uses Sheepskin Chair Cover can be used for children's room, Dog/Cat Bed Mat, bedroom, sofa, etc. And can also be used as gifts for your family and friends on Children's Day, Father's Day, Mother's Day, Christmas. Satisfaction Service 180-days No-question Refund: If there any problem of quality, please contact us for a replacement or refund. we will reply with our warm within 24 hours. About Packing: Fur Chair Pad may have been tightly packaged, so the wool may appear flattened.Fur Seat Cushion are very resilient and will bounce back to their original appearance and wouldn’t affect the quality of Sheepskin Chair Pad.A vigorous shake will help Fur Seat Pad restore the soft, fluffiness of the wool.Any fold marks will disappear once Sheepskin Chair Cover has been removed from the package for several days. Machine Wash Steps: 1. Leave the Fur Seat Pad in the laundry bag.2. Add a small amount of mild detergent.3. Set the machine on the gentle or delicate setting.4. Machine dehydration, do not tumble dry.5. Shake and brush it to fluff up the faux fur when take out the Sheepskin Chair Covers.6. Choose a site that's well ventilated for air drying.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61l8JhsVjcL._AC_SL1124_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"heetly","source_asin":"B082L2S7DK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-911801","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082L2S7DK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082L2S7DK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
