window.products.push({"id":911935,"name":"Homemate Heated Weighted Blanket - 50\"x60\" 10lbs Electric Blanket Fast Heating Heavy Throw Blanket 1/2/4/6/8 Hour Auto Off 10 Heat Settings Over-heat ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vPeQKzHDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【The Warmest Gift】: On a cold night, you need a warm hug. Give L'AGRATY heated weighted blanket as a gift to your favorite person, giving him/her warmth and comfort. L'AGRATY heated weighted blanket makes you feel like you are in a warm embrace, making you fall asleep more comfortably. L'AGRATY combines an heated blanket and a weighted blanket into one, which can not only give you warmth, but also give you comfortable pressure, making you feel like falling asleep in a warm embrace every night. 【Comfortable Material】: L'AGRATY heated weighted blanket uses 220GSM flannel and 230GSM sherpa, and 0.8-1mm non-toxic glass beads. The glass beads are evenly dispersed in 15x15cm spuares, thus ensuring the uniform weight distribution.The 8-foot-long power cord allows the blanket to be used both on the bed and on the sofa. The controller uses an LED display, which can clearly display information even at night when there is no light. 【The Most Free Control Experience】: L'AGRATY heated weighted blanket has 10 heat settings.The temperature range is from 77℉ to 131℉.This blanket has 5 auto shut off times, 1/2/4/6/8 hours auto shut off,so you don’t have to worry about wasting power when you forget to turn off after falling asleep,and it is also safer. There are two buttons on the controller to control temperature and time respectively. The operation is very convenient, even the elderly can easily understand and learn to use it. 【Safety&Energy Saving】: L'AGRATY heated weighted blanket uses NTC overheating protection technology. There are dozens of temperature measurement points distributed on the blanket.These measurement points will constantly monitor the temperature. If the temperature is too high, the blanket will automatically reduce the power, thereby reducing the temperature. It will provide users a most suitable temperature.At the same time,it is conducive to energy saving. 【Cleaning Precautions】: Spot cleaning is recommended. Do not machine wash. Note: Please read the instructions carefully before use. Correct use can maximize the service life of the heated weighted blanket, and it can avoid more than 95% of safety issues. If you encounter any problems during use, you can contact us at any time. We have a 7x24-hour customer service that can answer any questions you have about the product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vPeQKzHDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HomeMate","source_asin":"B0BGSVKR6P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-911935","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGSVKR6P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGSVKR6P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
