window.products.push({"id":911991,"name":"HueLiv 40x24 Inch LED Bathroom Vanity Mirror Light with 3X Magnification, Anti-Fog Dimmable Lighted Wall Mounted Mirror Makeup with Touch Control IP44","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619opXHYY6L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【3x Magnifying Lens & Modern Style】The 5MM HD lighted vanity mirror is undoubtedly stylish. The built-in round 3x magnification is integrated with the glass. You can see the details of face easily. It's suitable for daily use, such as shaving, makeup, etc. There is not only 0.78IN width led light on the surface of mirror, but also the additional LED light embedded on the side of mirror. The mirror comes with IP44 and moisture-proof backing, ensuring safe lighting in humid bathroom environments. 【3 Color Temperatures & Dimmable LED Mirror】HueLiv bathroom mirror adopts touch control design, which is more aesthetic and elegant. 3 color temperatures are available. You can choose 3000K warm white to 6000K cool white according to your needs. The vanity mirror with lights is also stepless dimming. You could just touch the button for 3 seconds to change the LED from 10% to 100%, which allows you to appreciate yourself in the most realistic light for makeup and skin care. 【 Defogging Function】Different from conventional mirrors, HueLiv lighted bathroom mirror has the anti-fog function, which could eliminates the fog. It’s the dual touch control button design. You don't need to worry that the steam full of the mirror, it will defog automatically after it's turned on, which provides you a better shower experience. Adopts unique smooth edges technology, anti-rust treatment, not easy to be oxidized and rust. It's more durable for years use. 【Control Modes】The 40x24 inch bathroom vanity mirror can be hung horizontally. The led vanity mirror comes with a plug that can be directly plugged into the switch. The length of power plug wire is 6.56FT. The control of power ON/OFF and defogging is individual, so you could use the defogging function separately as your preference. Not for Wall Switch 【UL Listed Power & Enhanced Packaging】The power supply is UL approved, which is much safer. The net weight of mirror is 11kgs. Good packaging can better protect each side of the mirror, especially the corners of the mirror. The bathroom vanity mirror passed all tests, including drop, impact, heavy pressure test, etc. If there is anything wrong with the led vanity mirror you receive, please feel free to contact us and we will give the best solution to satisfy you 100%.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619opXHYY6L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HueLiv","source_asin":"B08JTRR6W5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-911991","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JTRR6W5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JTRR6W5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
